{"version":1,"content":"<p>新婚的邱士縉（Stanley）與太太李炘頤（Alina）日前首以夫妻身分，出席於一級歷史建築虎豹別墅舉辦的品牌活動，同場還有劉嘉玲、馮允謙及炎明熹等。</p><p>Stanley與Alina同以黑色服飾示人，造型格調延續婚禮上黑色婚紗的風格，展現優雅而鮮明的個性。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:39.798121+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:41:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:24.195537+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:39.798121+00:00","content_hash":"5a5a7594fe7906e80f2c2c7122573ed3737e1928d28017664535c6880684a3bc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}